Catalog data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository redistributes a transformed subset of publicly available
course and program information published by The Pennsylvania State University
at https://bulletins.psu.edu, under psu-planner/apps/web/public/catalog/.

The data is factual (course codes, titles, credits, prerequisite text,
requirement tables) and has been mechanically restructured into JSON by the
scraper in psu-catalog-pipeline/. It is provided for the operation of this
planner only, and it is NOT covered by the Apache License above; the
underlying content remains the property of its publisher.

This project is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or an official product of
The Pennsylvania State University. "Penn State", "Nittany Lion", and related
marks belong to the University. Course data may be out of date or incorrect.
Always verify your plan with your academic adviser and LionPATH before
registering.

Advising flowchart PDFs referenced by the pipeline are published by the Penn
State College of Engineering and are used here as a source for deterministic
statistical priors only; they are not redistributed in this repository.

